# The sdist carries the documents a recipient needs to evaluate the
# release without the repository: the changelog (what shipped, per
# cycle) and the contributor/community documents. docs/ and examples/
# stay out deliberately — the sdist already ships the full test suite
# via setuptools defaults, and the documentation set is large and
# versioned with the repository, not the artifact.
include CHANGELOG.md
include CONTRIBUTING.md
include CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
